  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given system of linear equations are<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>For system to have no solution,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;must be equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
